  executionSurface: modalities::logic::deontic;
  curationStatus: Proposed;
  @condition: (4) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person imports therapeutic goods into Australia; and (b) the goods are imported without the consent in writing of the Secretary; and (c) the goods do not conform with a standard applicable to the goods (other than by reason of a matter relating to labelling or packaging). Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or both.;
  @action: The person commits an offence if they import therapeutic goods without consent.;
}

